            "<p>Lost empire to Sher Shah Suri but later regained it</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Akbar (1556–1605)</p>",
            "<p>Greatest Mughal ruler, strong administration</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
